  "releaseNotes": "Update README and improve reflection handling in ClassHelper\nEnhanced `readme.md` with code examples for reflection utilities, INI file operations, ZIP handling, CSV processing, DLL loading, and configuration management. Added a detailed API overview for helper classes.\n\nIn `ClassHelper.cs`, removed `BindingFlags.Static` from field and property retrieval methods to focus on instance members. Introduced new methods for accessing static methods and improved error messages for better clarity.",
